<title>USA: Franklin Ophthalmic releases catalog.</title>
<headline>Franklin Ophthalmic releases catalog.</headline>
<dateline>ROMEOVILLE, Ill. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Ophthalmic Instruments Co Inc said Wednesday it released its first direct mail sales catalog in more than two-and-a-half years.</p>
<p>The direct mailing will be comprised of 40,000 catalogs being distributed to eye doctors and eye centers throughout the United States.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
